# @env dev

### Get all posts
GET {{apiUrl}}/v1/posts

### Get post by id
GET {{apiUrl}}/v1/posts/2

### Create a new post
POST {{apiUrl}}/v1/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Post One",
  "content": "This is post one body"
}

### Delete a post by id
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/v1/posts/2
